OL,3,GNEWSAResidents evacuated after blaze at
OL,4,Ablock of flats
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents have been evacuated from a
OL,7,Fblock of flats in Dorset after a fire.
OL,9,FDorset & Wiltshire Fire & Rescue
OL,10,FService were called to Keel House in
OL,11,FDorchester Road, Weymouth, at about
OL,12,F00:45 BST after a blaze on the top
OL,13,Ffloor spread to the roof space.
OL,15,FAt the height of the fire, eight
OL,16,Fappliances, including a support unit
OL,17,Fand aerial ladder platform (ALPs), were
OL,18,Fat the scene.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,334,330,200,160,0,100
