OL,3,GNEWSAResidents evacuated after blaze at
OL,4,Ablock of flats
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn an update at about 10:00, the fire
OL,7,Fservice said that three appliances and
OL,8,Fan ALP remained at the site, with road
OL,9,Fclosures in place and people advised to
OL,10,Favoid the area.
